    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d17">

                <pb facs="0094" n="14" sameAs="frus:frus1901/pg14"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hay to Mr. Von Callenberg</hi>,</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1901-09-16"><hi rendition="#italic">September 16,
                        1901</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>I have charged the United States minister at Vienna to make on behalf of the
                    President suitable acknowledgment of the sympathetic <pb facs="0095" n="15"
                        xml:id="pg15"/> message of His Imperial and Royal Majesty which you conveyed
                    by your telegram of the 15th instant.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">John Hay.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
